Dr. Khalifa: I, I don't remember the specifics, but...

00:55:11.000 --> 00:55:14.000
control yourself is... I would ignore those people.

00:55:17.000 --> 00:55:20.000
You should not get into any fist fights or anything like that. Just ignore it.

00:55:21.000 --> 00:55:32.000
Dr. Khalifa: It, it takes more strength to restrain yourself than to get provoked into a fist fight or any of those silly things. You'll be a bigger man if you walk away and ignore them.

00:55:32.000 --> 00:55:35.000
A man: (unintelligible)

